// ── :data:* ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Implements the repository contracts defined in :domain:*.
// Each module maps to one business context and knows how to
// fetch, store, and synchronize data — from the network,
// the local database, or both (offline-first strategy).
// Features never talk to :data:* directly; they go through
// UseCases in :domain:*.
//
// Internal structure (same pattern for every :data:* module):
//   repository/
//     XxxRepositoryImpl.kt      → implements domain XxxRepository interface
//   remote/
//     XxxRemoteDataSource.kt    → Ktor API calls
//     dto/
//       XxxDto.kt               → JSON response models
//   local/
//     XxxLocalDataSource.kt     → Room DAO wrapper
//     entity/
//       XxxEntity.kt            → Room @Entity table
//   mapper/
//     XxxMapper.kt              → DTO / Entity ↔ Domain model conversions
//   di/
//     XxxDataModule.kt          → DI bindings for this context
//
// Depends on  : :domain:*, :core:network, :core:database, :core:common
// Must NOT import : :feature:*, :composeApp, :shared:design-system